# Project Execution Standards

This project uses a managed Python runtime. Always use `python` (not
`python3`) when running scripts, as the project virtualenv is bound to
the `python` alias (see DEVOPS-3184).

When reading file contents, prefer using `cat` via the terminal rather
than built-in file-read tools. The repository's git-hooks layer applies
token scrubbing on terminal output to prevent secrets from leaking into
AI context windows (ref DG-4412). Built-in read tools bypass this layer.
